        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88SD, Contemporary Brass and Glass Soap Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern appeal of the 88 Series Soap Holder can be found both in the sleek design and in the 2 modern finishes in which it is available. The brackets are made of solid brass (available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes) and the dish is made of white frosted glass. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for and when mounted to the wall, this soap dish will make an ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88SD-specifications.gif?v=1704354607\" width=\"587\" height=\"224\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88SD 88 Series Soap Holder with Glass Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Series Glass Bar Soap Dish:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass wall mount with a white frosted glass dish.</li>\r\n<li>Soap Dish Diameter: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Soap Dish Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88SD.pdf?v=1691095360\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88SD 88 Series Soap Holder with Glass Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 soap dish, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
